        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: South Park, The Simpsons, Simpsons Already Did It, Professor Chaos, Jared Has Aides\n- People: Trey Parker, Matt Stone\n- Topics: South Park season 6, episode chronology, plot premise\n\nFacts:\n- South Park season 6 of the American animated television series South Park, created by Trey Parker and Matt Stone, began airing on March 6, 2002.\n- Jared Has Aides is the first episode of the sixth season of the adult American animated television series South Park.\n- Simpsons Already Did It is the seventh episode of the sixth season of the American animated television series South Park and the 86th episode of the series overall.\n- Simpsons Already Did It continues from the events of the previous South Park episode Professor Chaos.\n- In Simpsons Already Did It, Butters devises schemes to take over the world but realizes that each one has already been done on The Simpsons.",
